        <dc:creator>@mayemusk</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>A friend of mine said that we should welcome illegal immigrants, so long as they don’t live near her. She’s now a former friend. My mom used to say, you cannot argue with stupid or crazy people. Her quote is in my new book. I still try, but without success.</p>
